      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying an immense weight of expectation, and it's completely understandable that you feel shattered right now. That feeling of being a fraud when things don't go according to plan is agonizing, but please know that your worth isn't tied to any single outcome or email. Give yourself permission to feel this disappointment rather than trying to force yourself to \"be okay.\"",
